---
description: How to write changelog entries for release-desk services.
globs: "**/CHANGELOG.md"
alwaysApply: false
targets: [cursor]
---
When editing a CHANGELOG.md:

- Add the entry under a heading that matches the version being released.
- Write each change as one sentence that a customer could act on.
- Mention removed or renamed routes first.
- A missing entry blocks the release; run the `check-readiness` tool afterwards
  to confirm the changelog check passes.
